# Line endings.
#
# AlpenFlight and its planning artifacts use LF only, in the repository and in
# the working tree. This holds on Windows, macOS, and Linux.
#
# flsserver/ and flsweb/ are read-only upstream repositories. Git must not
# convert them, because a converted line ending is drift from upstream.

* text=auto eol=lf

/flsserver/** -text
/flsweb/**    -text
